### 81. CORS Preflight from allowed origin :5500 (Expect: 200 + Access-Control-Allow-Origin)
OPTIONS http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Origin: http://localhost:5500
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Authorization, Content-Type

### 82. CORS Preflight from disallowed origin (Expect: 403 Invalid CORS request)
OPTIONS http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Origin: http://evil.example.com
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST